## 4. File Change Summary Tables

| File Path | Action | Component / Section | Change Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `src/store/chats.js` | Modify | `actions.importChat` | Returns the saved chat directly and only caches it when it belongs to the **active** project, preventing imported cross-project chats from leaking into the current board views or being destroyed by a subsequent `deleteBoard` (move). |
| `src/store/kanban.js` | Modify | `actions.importBoard` | Result now also returns `project: targetProject` (lets the caller know whether the board landed in the active project). |
| `src/store/kanban.js` | Modify | `actions.copyBoardToProject` | **New.** Exports the board and re-imports it into the chosen project, adapting every project-bound setting (source board untouched). |
| `src/store/kanban.js` | Modify | `actions.moveBoardToProject` | **New.** Copies the board, then deletes the source board **only after** the copy succeeded (virtual board guarded). |
| `src/components/kanban/board/BoardTransferModal.vue` | Modify | template + script | **Export to clipboard** ("Copy to clipboard" via `$storex.ui.copyTextToClipboard`), **paste-from-clipboard import**, and a new **Copy / Move** tab with destination picker, same-project guard and a two-step move confirmation. Source-board summary hoisted above the tabs and shared by all tabs. |
| `src/components/kanban/board/KanbanBoardView.vue` | Modify | `methods.onBoardImported` | No longer clears/switches the current board when the import landed in another project (`boardById` only resolves the active project's boards). |

**Behaviour notes**
- **Export to clipboard** serializes the exact same portable document as "Download" and copies it via the app-wide `copyTextToClipboard` helper (consistent "Text copied" feedback).
- **Copy** keeps the source board; **Move** removes it afterwards. Both adapt target-relative data: `owner_project_id`/`project_id`, `parent_id`/`linked_chat_ids`/`chat_links` → new ids, `file_list` + message `files` → target path prefix, `board`/`sprints` membership, and `session_id` cleared.
- Copying/moving **into the source project is blocked** (`isSameProject`) since it is not a transfer.
- The virtual **"No board"** board cannot be exported or moved (guarded in both UI and store).
- Because imported chats of a **non-active** project are no longer cached in the chats store, returning to the source project shows the board exactly once, and a move can never delete the newly copied tasks.

