### Behaviour notes
- **Entry point**: reachable from both the kanban toolbar (**Board** → settings) and the sprint header (**Board settings**), since both open the same shared modal.
- **Confirmation**: always shown; a `btn-error` confirm is separated from Cancel.
- **Kanban**: a checkbox (checked by default) asks whether to delete the tasks too. Unchecked → tasks are kept and moved to the virtual **"No board"** board (`board`/`column` cleared).
- **Sprint**: no delete-chats option; the tasks are always kept and simply removed from the sprint (`sprints` filtered) — matching `removeTaskFromSprint`.
- **Move** (`moveBoardToProject`) keeps deleting the source tasks (they were copied to the target), so no duplicated/orphaned cards are left behind.
- The virtual **"No board"** board is never deletable (guarded in the UI and in the store).

